### BlackBox API — Phase 1 sample requests
###
### Works with the VS Code REST Client and JetBrains HTTP Client.
### Run top to bottom: the login request captures tokens into variables that
### the later requests reuse.

@host = http://localhost:8000
@api = {{host}}/api/v1
@adminEmail = admin@blackbox.example.com
@adminPassword = ChangeMe123!


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Health
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Liveness probe
GET {{host}}/health

### Readiness probe (checks PostgreSQL and Redis)
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### OpenAPI schema
GET {{host}}/openapi.json


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Authentication
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Register a new account (gets the `viewer` role)
POST {{api}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "engineer@example.com",
  "password": "Str0ng!Passw0rd",
  "full_name": "Field Engineer"
}

### Log in as the bootstrap administrator
# @name login
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

@accessToken = {{login.response.body.access_token}}
@refreshToken = {{login.response.body.refresh_token}}

### Current user profile
GET {{api}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Rotate the refresh token (the old one is revoked)
POST {{api}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Change your own password
POST {{api}}/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "current_password": "{{adminPassword}}",
  "new_password": "N3w!Str0ngPass"
}

### Request a password-reset email
### With EMAIL_BACKEND=console the link is printed in the backend logs.
POST {{api}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "engineer@example.com"
}

### Complete the password reset (paste the token from the emailed link)
POST {{api}}/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "PASTE_TOKEN_FROM_EMAIL_LINK",
  "new_password": "N3w!Str0ngPass"
}

### Log out of the current session
POST {{api}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Log out everywhere
POST {{api}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "all_sessions": true
}


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Users (admin only)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### List users
GET {{api}}/users?page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Search by name or email, filtered by role
GET {{api}}/users?q=engineer&role=engineer&is_active=true
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### List assignable roles
GET {{api}}/users/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create a user with an explicit role
# @name createUser
POST {{api}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "engineer2@example.com",
  "password": "Str0ng!Passw0rd",
  "full_name": "Engineer Two",
  "roles": ["engineer"],
  "is_active": true,
  "is_verified": true
}

@userId = {{createUser.response.body.id}}

### Fetch a single user
GET {{api}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Promote a user to engineer
PATCH {{api}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roles": ["engineer"]
}

### Deactivate a user (revokes all of their sessions)
PATCH {{api}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "is_active": false
}

### Update your own profile
PATCH {{api}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Platform Administrator"
}

### Delete a user
DELETE {{api}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Audit trail (admin only)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Recent security events
GET {{api}}/audit-logs?page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Failed logins only
GET {{api}}/audit-logs?action=user.login_failed
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
